so uh the blessed one then uh got them together and he spoke to them he said look he said there are four kinds of fears to be expected by one who goes down to the water now what are the four fear of waves fear of crocodiles fear of whirlpools and fear of sharks and four kinds of fetters

83
00:08:57,787 --> 00:09:02,792
are to be expected by certain persons who have gone forth from home to homelessness.

84
